      "content": "i don't know. it doesn't feel like i'm \"standing\" in anything. i feel more like a shadow that's losing its shape. everything is just so quiet and heavy. sometimes i just wonder why i'm even bothering to keep up the act of being alive when the person everyone knew is already gone. it would just be easier if i could just... stop the noise. if i could just be as invisible as i feel.",
